{"sourceUrl":"https://zhxy.ecust.edu.cn/2025/0909/c6481a181941/page.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T17:00:56.510828+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://zhxy.ecust.edu.cn/2025/0909/c6481a181941/page.htm","html":"<div><p><span>一、</span><span>本学院推免生只接受全日制推免生，</span><span>原则上</span><span>采取线下面试形式。</span></p><p><span> </span></p><p><span>二、</span><span>各专业外校推荐免试研究生提前面试时间计划</span></p><p><span> </span></p><p><strong><span>面试专业：</span></strong><strong></strong></p><p><span>学术型：环境科学与工程、</span><span>热能工程</span><span>、储能科学与工程；</span></p><p><span>专业学位：环境工程、安全工程、清洁能源技术</span></p><p><span> </span></p><p><strong><span>第一批</span></strong><strong><span> <span>预</span></span></strong><strong><span>面试</span></strong><strong><span>时间</span></strong><strong><span>：</span></strong><strong><span><span>9</span><span>月</span><span>12</span><span>日</span></span></strong><strong><span>（周</span></strong><strong><span>五</span></strong><strong><span>）</span></strong><strong><span> <span>全天</span></span></strong><span>。</span><span>此批次为夏令营营员专场。面试时间、地点、形式另行通知。</span></p><p><span> </span></p><p><strong><span>第</span></strong><strong><span>二</span></strong><strong><span>批</span></strong><strong><span> <span>预</span></span></strong><strong><span>面试</span></strong><strong><span>时间</span></strong><strong><span>：</span></strong><strong><span><span>9</span><span>月</span><span>19</span><span>日</span></span></strong><strong><span>（周</span></strong><strong><span>五</span></strong><strong><span>）</span></strong><strong><span><span>至</span><span>9</span><span>月</span><span>21</span><span>日</span></span></strong><strong><span>（周</span></strong><strong><span>日</span></strong><strong><span>）</span></strong><strong><span> <span>三天内。计划每天设</span><span>1-2</span><span>组面试组。参加提前面试的学生</span></span></strong><span>需在面试前一天到本校徐汇校区报到，面试</span><span>地点：</span><span><span>本校徐汇校区（梅陇路</span><span>130</span><span>号）；面试分组、时间：</span></span><span>报到时</span><span>抽签</span><span>。</span></p><p><span>报到</span><span>时间</span><span>：</span><span>面试前一天下</span><span>午</span><span>13:30</span><span>-</span><span>15</span><span>:30<span>；地点：</span></span><span>六教东楼</span><span>21</span><span>3</span><span>室。</span></p><p><span> </span></p><p><span>即日起我院分批审核申请信息，本着先申请先审核的原则，择优初选。初选通过结果将通过邮件通知预报名考生，请考生查询报名邮箱，并请尽快答复是否参加面试（第二批）。对有意参加预面试的考生，会通过邮件通知如何报名面试。面试分组有限，面试分组额满为止。分组面试时间一旦确定原则上不接受考生私人行程原因的调整。</span></p><p><span> </span></p><p><span>我院将</span><span>视录取情况决定是否增加</span><span>第三批，将另行邮件或电话通知。</span></p><p><span> </span></p><p><span>三、</span><span>考生注意事项</span></p><p><span>1. </span><strong><span>考生报到携带材料：</span></strong><strong></strong></p><p><span>（1）</span><span>考生需携带第二代居民身份证、学生证原件</span><span>证明身份</span></p><p><span>（2）</span><span><span>请提供以下面试材料</span><span>1</span><span>套，包括简历</span><span>1</span><span>份（限打在</span><span>1</span><span>张</span><span>A4</span><span>纸内）、</span></span><span>大学成绩单复印件、四六级证书复印件；</span></p><p><span>（3）</span><span>考生可以提供在本科阶段公开发表的学术论文、科研成果以及在国内外重大竞赛中获奖等相关材料。</span></p><p><span>所有材料黑白打印即可。</span></p><p><span>2. </span><strong><span>学院招生</span></strong><strong><span>政策宣讲：</span></strong><strong></strong></p><p><span><span>学院已专门做过</span><span>2026</span><span>研究生招生线上宣讲会，请线上回看，</span><span>https://yzconsole.360eol.com/web/pc/ny.html?id=8208</span></span><span>。</span></p><p><strong><span>3. <span>面试</span></span></strong><strong></strong></p><p><span><span>（</span>1<span>）复试形式：面试；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span>2<span>）复试内容及分值（满分</span><span>100</span><span>分）：外语口语交流能力（</span><span>10</span><span>分），专业素质及综合能力（</span><span>90</span><span>分）。</span></span></p><p><strong><span>4. <span>建议提前联系导师。</span></span></strong><strong></strong></p><p><span> </span></p><p><span>四、</span><span>特别提醒</span></p><p><span>1. <span>获得母校推免生考生即日起</span></span><span>按华东理工大学</span><span>2026</span><span>年接收外校推荐免试研究生（含直博生）预报名通知《》</span><span><span>至</span>9</span><span><span>月</span><span>19</span></span><span>日</span><span>9:00</span><span><span>前到我校研究生院网上预报名。网址：</span>https://yz.ecust.edu.cn/<span>或者联系黄老师，联系电话：</span><span>021-64252399</span><span>，邮箱：</span><span>zhy</span></span><span>z</span><span>_ecust@163.com<span>，办公室：华东理工大学徐汇校区六教东楼</span><span>213</span><span>室。</span></span></p><p><span>2. </span><span>完成预报名且</span><span>有意参加面试的同学</span><span>，请注意查收邮件（会根据考生系统填报邮箱回邮）。如有疑问可以邮件到</span><span>zhy</span><span>z</span><span>_ecust@163.com</span><span>或电话咨询（</span><span>021-64252399</span><span>）。</span></p><p><span>3. <span>有意向报考华东理工大学的考生务必在规定时间内登陆教育部的全国推免服务系统（网址</span><span>:http://yz.chsi.com.cn/tm</span><span>）报考我校；最终推免生录取名单以教育部</span><span>“</span><span>推免服务系统</span><span>”</span></span><span>公布的</span><span>为准。</span></p><p><span> </span></p><p><span> </span></p><p><span>资源与环境工程学院</span></p><p><span>202</span><span>5</span><span><span>年</span>9<span>月</span></span><span>9</span><span>日</span></p><p><br/></p></div>","textSha256":"6a98a881710911b1dd995ed88f0b3ee3d6a75c66de9835fd7e88927d32228f44","textLength":1172,"sourceSha256":"df1192d617a2f6f596fc3b24ee170b85b6f0b7b965c974aef1a8503c77094cfe","selector":".wp_articlecontent","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-d10503349d877df47f56","title":"2025年华东理工大学资源与环境工程学院2026年接收外校推荐免试研究生提前面试通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T17:00:56.510828+00:00"}
